OL,3,GNEWSANightly #1.30 tourism tax plan
OL,4,Afaces axe after strong opposition
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nightly tourism tax plan between 75p
OL,7,Fand #1.30 on Anglesey faces the axe
OL,8,Fafter strong opposition.
OL,10,FThe council delayed its decision after
OL,11,Fa public consultation prompted
OL,12,Fthousands of responses from visitors,
OL,13,Fresidents and businesses.
OL,15,FIt was estimated the tax would raise
OL,16,Fabout #1.2m to #1.5m a year for the
OL,17,Fisland.
OL,19,FBut visitors and and the tourism sector
OL,20,Fwere against it.
